1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
One note. Four useful drafts.
Less copying. More room for the event.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Give the brief some space.
Write the date, place, duties and known prices on a full Notes page.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Choose your AI provider.
Gemma via Google or GPT-OSS via Groq. Optional fallback needs permission for both.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
A proper invitation.
Apply a formal or informal letter. Add only the contact details you actually know.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
A schedule you can edit.
Keep the supplied durations. Later proposed timings stay labelled Suggested.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Turn gaps into review items.
Unknown task owners and dates stay blank and block approval until resolved.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Costs that add up.
50 × NGN 300 + 50 × NGN 100 = NGN 20,000. A NGN 30,000 limit leaves NGN 10,000.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Your event. Your final say.
Review every section. Save a named pack in this browser, then export a backup.
